.TH QUIPU-HOOKS-UNINSTALL 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-hooks\-uninstall \- Remove quipu\*(Aqs hooks from Claude Code or Codex
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu hooks uninstall\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-harness\fR] [\fB\-\-project\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-st\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove quipu\*(Aqs hooks from Claude Code or Codex
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-harness\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-project\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-no\-st\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
